{{#> layout title="Your package is on its way"}}
<p>Hi {{greeting}},</p>
<p>Your package <strong>{{trackingCode}}</strong> is out for delivery.</p>
<p><a href="{{trackingUrl}}">Track it live</a></p>
<p style="margin-bottom:4px;color:#666">Delivery code</p>
<p style="font-size:32px;letter-spacing:6px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:0">{{otp}}</p>
<p>Give this code to the driver only when you have your package in hand.</p>
{{/layout}}